    "name": "Target Dragon 2: Maze Runner",
    "steam_appid": 3694770,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694770/extras/51b248c7ebe201ad1167e5b4aa6658c7.avif?t=1754031751\" data-has-big width=800 height=132 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Target Dragon 2: Maze Runner</strong> is a single-player fantasy RPG adventure where you battle dragons invading your village. As you progress through six different maps navigating through Dragon\u2019s labyrinths to reach LORD DRAGON, you complete various quests to upgrade your character. During battles with fantastical creatures, you can bring along a loyal pet dog; its automatic attack system lends you extra support by taking care of enemies on your behalf. Additionally, you have the option to nurture a fairy that grants you unique skills, helping to speed up your progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While gathering materials by engaging in activities such as mining, woodcutting, flower picking, and fishing, you can utilize the crafting system to refine your resources\u2014further boosted by hiring workers when needed. With the freedom to choose between male and female characters and play as a warrior, archer, or mage, this offline adventure features over 100 mazes, 1000 puzzles, and countless quests waiting for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694770/extras/c0e645eb5f5fd8a7c8538ae2327c3972.avif?t=1754031751\" data-has-big width=800 height=132 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 As you embark on your adventure, you must choose one of the warrior, archer, or mage characters and select the difficulty level you desire from easy, normal, or hard. You can continue the game across 25 different save.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694770/extras/16b6412b02f196646f2d266b4a64fa8c.poster.avif?t=1754031751\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694770/extras/16b6412b02f196646f2d266b4a64fa8c.webm?t=1754031751\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694770/extras/16b6412b02f196646f2d266b4a64fa8c.mp4?t=1754031751\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694770/extras/86cd10a90fc987c64eb813fd3092a911.avif?t=1754031751\" data-has-big width=800 height=132 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 You can easily obtain items and experience through quests that will be unlocked at different levels and regions. For this, you will need materials obtained from monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694770/extras/06a9954337a179a5abdd2699fda998d4.poster.avif?t=1754031751\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694770/extras/06a9954337a179a5abdd2699fda998d4.webm?t=1754031751\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694770/extras/06a9954337a179a5abdd2699fda998d4.mp4?t=1754031751\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694770/extras/e792b29fb1da39f09e4531636b37307a.avif?t=1754031751\" data-has-big width=800 height=132 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can obtain the materials and upgrades you need in the game from NPCs such as Sundries, Potions, Scrolls, Armors, Weapons, Anvil Master, Bank, and Repairman.\u00a0Don't forget, you need to have collected a lot of coins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694770/extras/cb83d4b012cdfbdecf7aa95f645fba17.poster.avif?t=1754031751\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694770/extras/cb83d4b012cdfbdecf7aa95f645fba17.webm?t=1754031751\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694770/extras/f417ec825424099f62e81d10f2ddddb9.avif?t=1754031751\" data-has-big width=800 height=132 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Another way to obtain items is by mining, fishing, chopping trees, and collecting flowers. You can then transform the Gem, Fish, Wood, and Flower you gather through crafting. Complete a large number of gathering quests or use contracts to have them completed for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694770/extras/4bdccb5600db7590ce3d298db6a6d4b5.poster.avif?t=1754031751\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694770/extras/4bdccb5600db7590ce3d298db6a6d4b5.webm?t=1754031751\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694770/extras/4bdccb5600db7590ce3d298db6a6d4b5.mp4?t=1754031751\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694770/extras/758b913d62b53e680d8fa86b71ca9561.avif?t=1754031751\" data-has-big width=800 height=132 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are a total of 1000 puzzles across 10 different levels. Combine the pieces and win the reward!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694770/extras/3092284bc99d771a004f19983c1ee2b5.poster.avif?t=1754031751\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694770/extras/3092284bc99d771a004f19983c1ee2b5.webm?t=1754031751\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694770/extras/3092284bc99d771a004f19983c1ee2b5.mp4?t=1754031751\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694770/extras/799b9d2179ea51592ffb66d3f90e2a2c.avif?t=1754031751\" data-has-big width=800 height=132 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete 100 different mazes across 10 levels and win rewards. Race against time to pass the mazes. You can leave directional markers to help yourself. If you enter the same maze again, they will guide you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694770/extras/943245505d1bc5d38a40180942bab21b.poster.avif?t=1754031751\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694770/extras/943245505d1bc5d38a40180942bab21b.webm?t=1754031751\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694770/extras/943245505d1bc5d38a40180942bab21b.mp4?t=1754031751\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694770/extras/223c067a3d91cac449a8e12b3b915321.avif?t=1754031751\" data-has-big width=800 height=132 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the automatic attack system, you can progress faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694770/extras/3483f61a63852c351776a11b66607c8d.poster.avif?t=1754031751\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694770/extras/3483f61a63852c351776a11b66607c8d.webm?t=1754031751\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694770/extras/3483f61a63852c351776a11b66607c8d.mp4?t=1754031751\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694770/extras/93e4f937e2afdfbf500910b42910ef75.avif?t=1754031751\" data-has-big width=800 height=132 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can raise a pet to attack monsters and collect items dropped by them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694770/extras/1d4c80929c34c12c890324fb9979a786.poster.avif?t=1754031751\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694770/extras/1d4c80929c34c12c890324fb9979a786.webm?t=1754031751\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694770/extras/1d4c80929c34c12c890324fb9979a786.mp4?t=1754031751\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
