\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694770/extras/16b6412b02f196646f2d266b4a64fa8c.poster.avif?t=1754031751\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694770/extras/16b6412b02f196646f2d266b4a64fa8c.webm?t=1754031751\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694770/extras/16b6412b02f196646f2d266b4a64fa8c.mp4?t=1754031751\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694770/extras/86cd10a90fc987c64eb813fd3092a911.avif?t=1754031751\" data-has-big width=800 height=132 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 You can easily obtain items and experience through quests that will be unlocked at different levels and regions. For this, you will need materials obtained from monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694770/extras/06a9954337a179a5abdd2699fda998d4.poster.avif?t=1754031751\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694770/extras/06a9954337a179a5abdd2699fda998d4.webm?t=1754031751\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694770/extras/06a9954337a179a5abdd2699fda998d4.mp4?t=1754031751\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" 